    "type": "game",
    "name": "Military Logistics Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 2947540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/1244cb6f20184d2849d19e3914256c9f.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military Logistics Simulator puts you behind the wheel of real-world military logistics. Rise from a low-ranking soldier to a seasoned quartermaster as you manage vehicles, expand your base, and take charge of critical supply lines. Deliver vital cargo and defend it from drone attacks, rescue survivors, and help rebuild a war-torn region after conflict \u2014 all in immersive first-person simulation. Play solo or with friends and earn your place, leading military operations from behind the lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/912deba78ff364531bb8441b2e0b1dc5.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/912deba78ff364531bb8441b2e0b1dc5.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/912deba78ff364531bb8441b2e0b1dc5.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport, deploy, and maintain critical military infrastructure \u2014 from air defense systems to artillery logistics and UAV operations \u2014 across high-risk zones.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/62771cafa54258c26f9625bddf469d08.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/62771cafa54258c26f9625bddf469d08.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/62771cafa54258c26f9625bddf469d08.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate and maintain a wide range of real-world military vehicles, including recon trucks, heavy transporters, UAV carriers, and recovery units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/08b23644c67e7e6445aa08d6a460e2ae.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/08b23644c67e7e6445aa08d6a460e2ae.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/08b23644c67e7e6445aa08d6a460e2ae.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete high-value contracts to earn funds, upgrade your fleet, expand your base, and invest in new and better buildings and infrastructure to unlock new vehicles and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/e9226079722d1cf629945654df073502.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/e9226079722d1cf629945654df073502.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/e9226079722d1cf629945654df073502.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your loyal German Shepherd to assist in search-and-rescue missions and send him out to sniff out explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to run large-scale logistics operations and play the captivating story together!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/1244cb6f20184d2849d19e3914256c9f.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military Logistics Simulator puts you behind the wheel of real-world military logistics. Rise from a low-ranking soldier to a seasoned quartermaster as you manage vehicles, expand your base, and take charge of critical supply lines. Deliver vital cargo and defend it from drone attacks, rescue survivors, and help rebuild a war-torn region after conflict \u2014 all in immersive first-person simulation. Play solo or with friends and earn your place, leading military operations from behind the lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/912deba78ff364531bb8441b2e0b1dc5.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/912deba78ff364531bb8441b2e0b1dc5.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/912deba78ff364531bb8441b2e0b1dc5.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport, deploy, and maintain critical military infrastructure \u2014 from air defense systems to artillery logistics and UAV operations \u2014 across high-risk zones.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/62771cafa54258c26f9625bddf469d08.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/62771cafa54258c26f9625bddf469d08.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/62771cafa54258c26f9625bddf469d08.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate and maintain a wide range of real-world military vehicles, including recon trucks, heavy transporters, UAV carriers, and recovery units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/08b23644c67e7e6445aa08d6a460e2ae.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/08b23644c67e7e6445aa08d6a460e2ae.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/08b23644c67e7e6445aa08d6a460e2ae.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete high-value contracts to earn funds, upgrade your fleet, expand your base, and invest in new and better buildings and infrastructure to unlock new vehicles and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/e9226079722d1cf629945654df073502.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/e9226079722d1cf629945654df073502.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/e9226079722d1cf629945654df073502.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your loyal German Shepherd to assist in search-and-rescue missions and send him out to sniff out explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.poster.avif?t=1755168510\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.webm?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.mp4?t=1755168510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to run large-scale logistics operations and play the captivating story together!</p>",
    "short_description": "Drive real military vehicles, deliver critical cargo, and master first-person logistics solo or with friends. Rescue survivors, provide infrastructure, and rebuild a war-torn region!",
